## Project purpose

Product catalog for Zanzibar Bricks masonry products.

- **Audience:** Builders, developers in Zanzibar
- **Geography:** Zanzibar/Tanzania

## Design style

Product catalog — masonry/brick focused imagery, straightforward B2B browsing.

- `assets/mockups/`

## Coding standards

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
