**Structure:** `src/`, `public/` · **Script:** `auto-push` watcher

## Preferred UI direction

- Simple catalog UX; mobile-friendly product grids
- Tailwind utility styling — no heavy component library
- Auto-push script exists — be careful with git automation

## Common tasks

- New product → route in React Router + product data file
- Images → `public/` or `assets/images/`
- Build → `npm run build` before deploy

## Folder rules

- **Scope rule:** Only modify files inside `/Users/apple/Zanzibaba-Projects/active-projects/zanzibar-bricks/` unless the user explicitly asks otherwise.
