- **Canonical path:** `/Users/apple/Zanzibaba-Projects/active-projects/zanzibar-bricks/` (symlinks may exist at legacy Desktop/cursor paths).

## Asset usage rules

- **Project-first:** Use `assets/logos/`, `assets/images/`, `assets/mockups/` before pulling from elsewhere.
- **Group logos:** Reference `../../shared-assets/logos/` for Zanzibaba Group PNG masters — copy to `public/` only when deploy requires a local path.
- **Brand guidelines:** Read `../../shared-assets/brand-guidelines/BRAND_GUIDELINES.md` before changing colors, fonts, or logo placement.
- **Do not** duplicate canonical logo PNGs across repos — symlink or import at build time when possible.
- **Do not** redraw, recolor, or add effects to approved logos (no drop shadows, gradients on emblem).
- **Partner/trust logos:** Keep 48px+ gap from group emblem when shown in the same row (procurement pattern).

